sequenceDiagram
    participant IoT as 📱 IoT Device
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant Celery as ⏱️ Celery Task
    participant MongoDB as 🗄️ MongoDB
    
    IoT->>ConAPI: POST /ingest {consumption: 5.2kWh}
    ConAPI->>ConAPI: Valida JWT token
    ConAPI-->>IoT: 202 Accepted
    ConAPI->>Celery: Queue task
    Celery->>MongoDB: Insert consumption_readings
    MongoDB-->>Celery: ✓ Stored
